  "description": "Makita DRT52Z 18V Li-ion LXT Brushless Router/Trimmer, Batteries and Charger Not Included - Distributed/Packaged by Makita. Product Details: Makita is the leading manufacturer of professional power tools on the market. The DRT52Z is a compact and lightweight cordless Router/Trimmer, powered by 18V Li-ion LXT slide type battery (not included), to supply energy to the powerful 18V brushless motor, with soft start, to deliver up to 30,000 rpm and 580 watts maximum power output. The DRT52Z is equipped with 6.35mm / ¼” collet chuck, push button power switch, lock/unlock button with on/off standby mode, LED lamp to indicate unlock, smooth and precision depth adjustment with rack and pinion mechanism, anti-restart function and high temperature warning lamp. The DRT52Z features plastic housing and a square transparent plastic base for clear view of the edge to be trimmed; 82 x 90mm. DRT52Z has a 0 to 42mm plunge capacity. DRT52Z is not compatible with G-Series batteries. 1 year manufacturer warranty with a further 2 years when registered within 30 days of purchase. This guarantee does not apply where non-genuine or recommended parts of accessories are fitted to the tool. The use of non-genuine or compatible batteries and chargers with Makita tools will invalidate the Makita guarantee for our tools.",
